    <statement><p>Find the sum of each of the geometric series given below.  For the
value of the sum, enter an expression that gives the exact value,
rather than entering an approximation.</p>
<p><alert>A.</alert>
<m>-6 + 3 - {3\over 2} + {3\over 4} - {3\over 8} + {3\over 16} - \cdots =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>B.</alert>
<m>\sum\limits_{n=5}^{13} \left({1\over 3}\right)^n =</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.00617252589343564</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>A.</alert>
<m>-6 + 3 - {3\over 2} + {3\over 4} - {3\over 8} + {3\over 16} - \cdots = {-6\over 1 + {1\over 2}} = -4</m>.




<alert>B.</alert>
<m>\sum\limits_{n=5}^{13} \left({1\over 3}\right)^n = {1\over 3^{5}}\cdot {1 - ({1\over 3})^{9}\over 1 - {1\over 3}} = {1\over 3^{4}}\cdot {(1 - ({1\over 3})^{9})\over 2}</m>.



</solution>
